chapter START:
	narrator "You sit by the campfire and inspect old cuts that never fully healed."
	player "I cannot keep ignoring this. If I am going to survive, I need to learn how to tend my wounds."
	narrator "You organize your bandages, clean your tools, and practice a steady routine."
	call unlockSkillById("medicine")
	call unlockActivity("tend_injuries")
	player "Better. Not perfect, but better."
	narrator "You've unlocked: Tend Injuries activity."
